    {
      "id": "5.60.2",
      "label": "5.60.2",
      "numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "devanagari": "दृष्टा देवी न च आनीता इति तत्र निवेदनम्\nअयुक्तम् इव पश्यामि भवद्भिः ख्यात विक्रमैः |",
      "iast": "dṛṣṭā devī na ca ānītā iti tatra nivedanam\nayuktam iva paśyāmi bhavadbhiḥ khyāta vikramaiḥ |",
      "translation": "\"I perceive it as improper to inform there that Seetha the princess, though seen by you of renowned prowess, has not been brought here.\"",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
