    {
      "id": "5.60.3",
      "label": "5.60.3",
      "numbers": [
        3
      ],
      "devanagari": "न हि वः प्लवते कश्चिन् न अपि कश्चित् पराक्रमे\nतुल्यः सामर दैत्येषु लोकेषु हरि सत्तमाः |",
      "iast": "na hi vaḥ plavate kaścin na api kaścit parākrame\ntulyaḥ sāmara daityeṣu lokeṣu hari sattamāḥ |",
      "translation": "\"O the best of monkeys! No one is equal to us even in our prowess nor indeed anyone who can leap like us in the worlds either of celestials or demons.\"",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "hari sattamaaH",
          "iast": "hari sattamāḥ",
          "devanagari": "हरि सत्तमाः",
