    {
      "id": "5.60.4",
      "label": "5.60.4",
      "numbers": [
        4
      ],
      "devanagari": "तेष्व् एवम् हत वीरेषु राक्षसेषु हनूमता\nकिम् अन्यत् अत्र कर्तव्यम् गृहीत्वा याम जानकीम् |",
      "iast": "teṣv evam hata vīreṣu rākṣaseṣu hanūmatā\nkim anyat atra kartavyam gṛhītvā yāma jānakīm |",
      "translation": "\"Hanuma indeed thus killed all the warriors among the demons. What work is remaining to be done by us? We will go, after taking Janaki.\"",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
