    {
      "id": "5.60.5",
      "label": "5.60.5",
      "numbers": [
        5
      ],
      "devanagari": "तम् एवम् कृत सम्कल्पम् जाम्बवान् हरि सत्तमः\nउवाच परम प्रीतो वाक्यम् अर्थवत् अर्थवित् |",
      "iast": "tam evam kṛta samkalpam jāmbavān hari sattamaḥ\nuvāca parama prīto vākyam arthavat arthavit |",
      "translation": "Jambavan, the foremost among the forest-animals, understanding the sense, was very much pleased and spoke the following meaningful words to that Angada, who thus formed a resolution.",
